#: ../../source/janim/anims_core/time.rst:2
msgid "time"
msgstr "time"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeRange:1 of
msgid "标识了从 ``at`` 开始，到 ``end`` 结束的时间区段"
msgstr "Identifies the time period starting at ``at`` and lasting for ``duration``."

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeRange:3 of
msgid "若 ``end`` 为 ``FOREVER``，则表示该时长是无限的"
msgstr "If ``end`` is ``FOREVER``, it means the duration is infinite"

#: ../../docstring janim.anims_core.time.TimeRange.at:1 of
msgid "时间区段的开始时刻"
msgstr "Start time of the time-range"

#: ../../docstring janim.anims_core.time.TimeRange.end:1 of
msgid "时间区段的结束时刻"
msgstr "End time of the time-range"

#: ../../docstring janim.anims_core.time.TimeRange.end:3 of
msgid "若为 ``FOREVER``，则表示该时长是无限的"
msgstr "If it is ``FOREVER``, it means the duration is infinite"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeRange.duration:1 of
msgid "时间区段的时长"
msgstr "Duration of the time range"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeRange.duration:3 of
msgid "如果 ``end=FOREVER`` 则抛出 ``AssertionError``"
msgstr "If ``end=FOREVER``, raises ``AssertionError``"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeRange.num_duration:1 of
msgid "当 ``end`` 不是 ``FOREVER`` 时，与 ``duration`` 一致"
msgstr "When ``end`` is not ``FOREVER``, it is the same as ``duration``"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeRange.num_duration:2 of
msgid "当 ``end`` 是 ``FOREVER`` 时，此时返回 ``0``"
msgstr "When ``end`` is ``FOREVER``, returns ``0``"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeRange.num_end:1 of
msgid "当 ``end`` 不是 ``FOREVER`` 时，与 ``end`` 一致"
msgstr "When ``end`` is not ``FOREVER``, it is the same as ``end``"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeRange.num_end:2 of
msgid "当 ``end`` 是 ``FOREVER`` 时，此时返回 ``at``"
msgstr "When ``end`` is ``FOREVER``, returns ``at``"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeRange.set:1 of
msgid "设置该时间区段的范围"
msgstr "Set the range of this time-range"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeRange.shift:1 of
msgid "以 ``delta`` 的变化量移动时间区段"
msgstr "Shift the time-range by ``delta``"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeRange.scale:1 of
msgid "以 ``k`` 的倍率缩放时间区段（相对于 ``t=0`` 进行缩放）"
msgstr "Scale the time-range by factor ``k`` (scaled relative to ``t=0``)"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeRange.copy:1 of
msgid "复制一份该对象"
msgstr "Creates a copy of this object"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeRange.contains:1 of
msgid "检查 ``t`` 是否位于该时间区段的内部"
msgstr "Checks whether ``t`` is within this time range"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeAligner:1 of
msgid "由于浮点数精度的问题，有可能出现比如原本设计上首尾相连的两个动画，却出现判定的错位"
msgstr ""
"Due to floating-point precision issues, it is possible that two animations designed to be connected end-to-end may have "
"misaligned judgments"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeAligner:3 of
msgid "该类用于将相近的浮点数归化到同一个值，使得 :class:`TimeRange` 区间严丝合缝"
msgstr ""
"This class is used to normalize nearby floating-point numbers to the same value, ensuring that :class:`TimeRange` "
"intervals fit together precisely"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeAligner.align_anim_and_record:1 of
msgid "归化 ``anim`` 的时间区段，并参与记录"
msgstr "Normalizes the time range of ``anim`` and records it"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeAligner.align_anim_and_record:3 of
msgid "即分别对其 ``.t_range.at`` 和 ``.t_range.end`` 进行 :meth:`align_and_record` 的操作"
msgstr "That is, performs :meth:`align_and_record` on its ``.t_range.at`` and ``.t_range.end`` respectively"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeAligner.align_and_record:1 of
msgid "对齐时间 ``t``，若没有极近的时间点，则记录"
msgstr "Aligns time ``t`` and records it if there is no nearby time point"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeAligner.align_and_record:3 of
msgid "确保极近的时间点归化到相同的值，返回归化后的时间值"
msgstr "Ensures that nearby time points are normalized to the same value and returns the normalized time value"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeAligner.align:1 of
msgid "尝试对齐时间 ``t`` 到极近的时间点，不参与记录"
msgstr "Attempts to align time ``t`` to a nearby time point without recording it"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeChunks:1 of
msgid "用于优化对带有 :class:`TimeRange` 信息的对象，基于特定时刻的检索"
msgstr "Used to optimize retrieval of objects with :class:`TimeRange` information based on a specific time"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeChunks:3 of
msgid "动机是："
msgstr "Motivation:"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeChunks:5 of
msgid ""
"我们在时间轴上可能会有一系列的对象，这些对象的“可视时间”是零散分布的， 我们并不希望在检索 “某个 ``t`` 时刻可视的有哪些” 时"
"遍历整个列表结构"
msgstr ""
"There may be a series of objects on the timeline whose \"visible times\" are scattered. When querying \"which objects are "
"visible at a certain time ``t``\", we do not want to traverse the entire list"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeChunks:8 of
msgid "但是由于这些可视时间是由区间表示的，所以不方便使用二分的方法来优化"
msgstr "However, since these visible times are represented by intervals, it is inconvenient to optimize using binary search"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeChunks:10 of
msgid ""
"该类的目的是，划分出各个区块，每个区块的时长为 ``step``，记录在各个区块中有哪些是可见的， 在检索 ``t`` 时刻可视物件时，调"
"用侧使用 :meth:`get` 方法，即可得到 ``t`` 时刻所在区块中的所有对象， 后续只需遍历这个区块内的对象检查是否可视即可"
msgstr ""
"The purpose of this class is to divide time into chunks, each with a duration of ``step``, and record which objects are "
"visible in each chunk. When retrieving visible objects at time ``t``, the caller can use :meth:`get` to obtain all "
"objects in the chunk containing ``t``, then only needs to check visibility among those objects"

#: ../../source/janim/anims_core/time.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeChunks:14 of
msgid "一系列的对象"
msgstr "A sequence of objects"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeChunks:17 of
msgid ""
"将每个对象对应到其 :class:`TimeRange` 的函数  可以返回单个 :class:`TimeRange`，也可以返回一个 :class:`TimeRange` 列表表示"
"多个可视的区段  注：不允许带有 ``FOREVER`` 时间的 :class:`TimeRange`"
msgstr ""
"A function that maps each object to its :class:`TimeRange`. It can return a single :class:`TimeRange`, or a list "
"of :class:`TimeRange` objects representing multiple visible intervals. Note: :class:`TimeRange` objects containing "
"``FOREVER`` are not allowed"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeChunks:18 of
msgid "将每个对象对应到其 :class:`TimeRange` 的函数"
msgstr "A function that maps each object to its :class:`TimeRange`"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeChunks:20 of
msgid "可以返回单个 :class:`TimeRange`，也可以返回一个 :class:`TimeRange` 列表表示多个可视的区段"
msgstr ""
"Can return a single :class:`TimeRange`, or a list of :class:`TimeRange` objects representing multiple visible intervals"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeChunks:22 of
msgid "注：不允许带有 ``FOREVER`` 时间的 :class:`TimeRange`"
msgstr "Note: :class:`TimeRange` objects with ``FOREVER`` duration are not allowed"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeChunks:24 of
msgid "每个区块的时长"
msgstr "The duration of each chunk"

#: janim.anims_core.time.TimeChunks.get:1 of
msgid "得到 ``t`` 时刻所在区块中的所有对象"
msgstr "Gets all objects in the chunk containing time ``t``"

#~ msgid "另见 :meth:`num_duration`"
#~ msgstr "See also :meth:`num_duration`"

#~ msgid "（这用于 :class:`~.AnimGroup` 对 ``end=FOREVER`` 的子动画的处理，也就是把这种子动画当成 ``end=at`` 来计算时间）"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "(This is used for :class:`~.AnimGroup` to handle child animations with ``end=FOREVER``, i.e., treating such child "
#~ "animations as ``end=at`` for time calculation)"

#~ msgid "与 :meth:`align_t` 类似，但区别在于"
#~ msgstr "Similar to :meth:`align_t`, but differs in that"

#~ msgid "该方法在查找后不记录 ``t`` 的值"
#~ msgstr "This method does not record the value of ``t`` after searching"
